- Packages 147 (61f514a8), 148 (44b2b9ce), 150 (14fbc163) -- 149 has no designer --
  merged in order, three-way, each on its own _machine_ai/base_*: mostly SAME /
  PKG-ONLY; CHANGELOG / HANDOVER / extension.js / run_tests.js merged clean;
  package.json conflicted on the version twice -> package 150's whole (compared
  item by item: every machine command / setting / menu / colour / activation event
  is in it, one keybinding more). ES02 0.165+ carries all the machine's patches
  (0143, 0151-0163; its dev/verify_machine_patches.js checks line by line); every
  machine feature is still in the merged code. test/vscode_run_it.ps1 (ES02 0.167)
  really builds and starts wb_serve under gdb: not run on the machine.
- The tree moved to C:\HT9045_ssd\_integ_ioweb; D:\HT9045\_integ_ioweb is a
  junction to it and the BCB6 golden tree stayed at D:\HT9045 -- walking up from
  the real path never found it (13 smoke failures: BCB6 jumps, Big5 view, golden
  search). lib/roots.js viaLinks: when the walk finds nothing, a junction /
  symlink in the first two levels of any drive pointing at the tree (or above it)
  and the same walk from there (readdir's dirent of a junction is not a directory
  -- isSymbolicLink taken too); cached 60 s. test/vscode_it.ps1: the same for its
  own golden lookup.

Tests: run_all 3/3 layers (lib 188, extension 244); real VS Code 153/159 (the 3
known stale checks + the BtnPanelLane3 selection set, as before).

